  "content": "<h2>關於</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbeautify-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/beautify-refabricated?color=00AF5C&amp;label=下載次數&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beautify-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_809311_downloads.svg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beautify-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/809311.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft 版本\"></a></p><h6>這是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beautify-decorate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Beautify</a> 的<strong>非官方 Fabric</strong> 版本，採用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Pandarix/Beautify/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT</a> 授權，請支持原始作品！</h6><h2>模組內容</h2><p><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/82240d271f55e1b30163f5c889c8d4f95414748cf105a2fc59511d868f8dca48/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f744453426968552e6a70672e706e67\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/cfe784fb6b44808f1e82645adcb35ff730f3565c4a536ff65520b869e15ac803/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f61566e3442366d2e676966\" alt=\"\"></p><p><span style=\"color:#9cf\"><strong>什麼是 Beautify？</strong></span></p><p>Beautify 是一個客戶端和伺服器端的<strong>裝飾模組</strong>，新增了許多<strong>原版風格</strong>的自訂模型方式，讓你的建築更添風采。</p><p>我的目標是在不扼殺想像力和創造力的前提下，增加建築的細節。<br>\n此外，大多數方塊都包含新功能。例如，盆栽植物（如1格高的花）可以使用骨粉複製。</p><p><span style=\"color:#9cf\"><strong>支援版本 [Fabric]：</strong> </span> 1.18.2 | 1.19.2 | 1.20.x</p><p><span style=\"color:#9cf\"><strong>更多圖片：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7wHu3qe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1155\" height=\"650\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LGUotre.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1155\" height=\"650\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M7AfS0o.png?1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1155\" height=\"446\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/63BR9j4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1155\" height=\"650\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beautify-refabricated/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#36f\">更多範例圖片</span></a></p></div><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#9cf\">&nbsp;<strong>Jeikir 的展示影片：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5uXGHUit038?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p></div><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>功能摘要：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">懸掛花盆</span>－自訂花朵模型，支援多種植物</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">書堆</span>－不同模型，可用於啟動附魔台</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">百葉窗</span>－為窗戶增添細節，或創造新型入口</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">畫框</span>－包含全部16x16原版繪畫動機及其他</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">繩索</span>－懸掛花盆及其他方塊可懸掛於其上，玩家可攀爬</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">新型光源</span>：竹燈、燭台/吊燈、螢光瓶、燈泡</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">格架</span>－便於在牆壁和天花板種植植物</li>\n<li><em>更多功能即將推出</em></li>\n</ul><p><em>如需更多方塊資訊及其用途，請<span style=\"color:#9cf\"><a style=\"color:#9cf\" href=\"https://github.com/Pandarix/Beautify/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">造訪 Wiki！</a></span></em></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">致謝：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:400\"><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/CapoFantasma97\" rel=\"nofollow\">CapoFantasma97</a></strong>（義大利文翻譯）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:400\"><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/ocarinayoy\" rel=\"nofollow\">ocarinayoy</a></strong>（西班牙文翻譯）</span></p>",
